    "premise": "Four nights ago the floor of Wrack Bay rose as a plain of black mud, and something the size of a hill came up with it and lay stranded at its edge. Since then the town of Wrackham dreams one dream every night and walks out onto the mud in its sleep, and three have not come back. Four strangers answer the harbourmistress's notice: find out what is happening and stop it before it gets worse, and bring her son home.",
